# =====================================================================
#  PART ONE: English text of the strings inside the processes
#  (parte1_proc.paw). The key is the SHA-1 of the Spanish string.
# =====================================================================

/STR a48cf671
Rocinante twitches an ear. That is all you will get out of him.
/STR 4b23787b raw
"You are carrying: "
/STR 59398e1e
You are the narrator, not the knight. Narrators don't attack: at most, they criticise.
/STR f59f0ca3
