/STR be9724fd
You look for the door of your library and cannot find it. Perhaps the housekeeper or your niece know something.
/STR 8e71c269
A corselet, a helmet, a sword and some iron bars, all covered in rust and mould.
/STR 3fe147d7
Your great-grandfathers' corselet, covered in rust and mould.
/STR a3348ecf
Your great-grandfathers' corselet, scoured and repaired. It almost shines.
/STR c11ad450
You clean the arms of your great-grandfathers and repair them as best you can. It takes you all afternoon.
/STR d27556f9
They shine as much as they ever will.
/STR 5d72b8e8
It is a helmet without a visor: a simple morion, open in front. Nobody could go anywhere like that.
/STR b89617cc
A helmet with a pasteboard visor. It looks like a proper closed helmet. Untested.
/STR c056b93c
A helmet with the remains of a pasteboard visor in shreds.
/STR 2a94cdf3
A very fine closed helmet, its visor strengthened inside with iron bars.
